{
  "name": "Jobs from company career sites to Google Sheets every morning",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Jobs from company career sites to Google Sheets every morning\n\nEvery morning, read the career site of each company you list (39 recruiting systems detected) and get every open job, and append the rows to a Google Sheet.\n\n### Setup (3 minutes)\n1. **Apify token** - create a free account at apify.com and copy your API token (Settings > API & Integrations).\n   In the **Get jobs from career sites** node, create a *Header Auth* credential: name `Authorization`, value `Bearer YOUR_TOKEN`.\n2. **Google Sheets** node - connect your Google account and paste the URL of an empty sheet. Columns are created from the data automatically.\n3. Edit the JSON body of **Get jobs from career sites** with your own inputs, then activate the workflow.\n\n**Cost:** $1.50 per 1,000 jobs, first 3 per run free. `maxTotalChargeUsd` in the body is a hard cap per run.\nActor: https://apify.com/om_kh/careers-page-scraper",
        "height": 460,
        "width": 460
      },
      "name": "Setup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
